     "author": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "From IRC: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://irclogs.fcrepo.org/2015-06-29.html"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://irclogs.fcrepo.org/2015-06-29.html",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "ajs6f> awoods: I'm proposing that whatever happens should become visible without the construction of a new URI.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<awoods> ajs6f: can you elaborate?",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ajs6f> awoods: There should be no fcr:tombstone. Whatever change in the representation of a resource we want to take place upon its deletion should be visible at the same URI as was the before-deletion representation.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ajs6f> awoods; Personally, I would be happy with an HTTP redirect to whereever. If you wanted to keep the thing you just deleted, you should have versioned it.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<awoods> ajs6f: Have you experimented with deleting a resource that has been versioned?",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ajs6f> awoods: I haven't even run Fedora in months. I try not to use it.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<awoods> ajs6f: My suspicion is that it is gone.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ajs6f> awoods: Then we can choose not to delete it. We can move it to a garbage can and leave a node in its place with a link to the old thing that appears in HTTP as a redirect. The important point is that it should not be a new URI.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "<ajs6f> awoods: And if people delete the redirect-thingy, the old resource gets garbage collected out of the can.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
